  "Description": "Provides a constant buffer with a resolution (width and height as floats).\n\nA pixel shader cannot query the size of the render target it writes into, so this buffer passes it explicitly.\n\nTips:\n- In most cases [RequestedResolution] with [FloatsToBuffer] or [IntsToBuffer] is more convenient.",
